      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "def rag_prompt(question, docs):\n    context = \"\\n\\n\".join([f\"[Doc {i+1}]: {d}\" for i, d in enumerate(docs)])\n    return f'''Answer using ONLY the provided context.\nIf the answer is not in the context, say \"I don't have that information.\"\n\nContext:\n{context}\n\nQuestion: {question}\n\nCite sources using [Doc N] format. Be concise (2-3 sentences).'''"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Based on these documents, answer the question. Cite each claim.\n\n[1] \"Returns accepted within 30 days of purchase.\"\n[2] \"Refunds processed in 5-7 business days.\"\n[3] \"Items must be in original packaging for full refund.\"\n\nQ: What do I need for a full refund?\nA: Items must be in original packaging [3] and returned within 30 days [1]. \n   Refunds take 5-7 business days [2]."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "system = '''You answer questions based ONLY on provided context.\n- Context has the answer: respond concisely with citations\n- Context partially relevant: answer what you can, state what is missing\n- Context irrelevant: say \"I don't have information about that.\"\n- NEVER make up facts not in the context'''"
        ]
      ]
    }
